<title>USA: Uniforce Services increases credit facility.</title>
<headline>Uniforce Services increases credit facility.</headline>
<dateline>WOODBURY, N.Y. 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Uniforce Services Inc said Monday it increased its credit facility with Heller Financial Inc to $46 million from $35 million.</p>
<p>The company said it plans to use its increased credit facility to provide working capital for its expected growth, including the financing of potential acquisitions.</p>
<p>Uniforce company began trading on the American Stock Exhange on June 26.</p>
